IALOGUE2", "caption": "Each brand of earphones is different from the others. The kind I like best are the in-ear types. There's no comparing the peace of mind which in-ear types give me as opposed to over-ear or clip-type earphones... And when you lend one to someone else, you also feel more connected to them."}, "780115": {"char_code": "Delisle", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "I'm going to beat the crap out of those two bitches next door sooner or later... Their music is crude and tacky and they love surround sound too! Anyone who blasts music out loud must be deaf!"}, "780116": {"char_code": "Delisle", "voice_key": "WIN", "caption": "So, how much of a bonus am I getting this time? Don't pretend you didn't hear me!"}, "780117": {"char_code": "Delisle", "voice_key": "RETREAT", "caption": "Dammit... My earphone wires got tangled..."}, "780118": {"char_code": "Delisle", "voice_key": "FEED", "caption": "The noise reduction could use some improvement..."}, "780119": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "780120": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "780121": {"char_code": "Delisle", "voice_key": "BREAK", "caption": "The, the sound's leaking through..."}, "780122": {"char_code": "Delisle", "voice_key": "MOOD2", "caption": ""}}}